window.products.push({"id":99183,"name":"Pacific Trusteam Under Cabinet Hood SC8836BS Bundle with Pacific SUS304 Deflector Board","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":999.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41KIvuk5VIL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"BUNDLE MAKES THE PERFECT - Premium deflector board compatible with TruSteam SC88/SC81, fits for both 30\" and 36\". More suction coverage. Easy to clean, dishwasher safe. Better appearance. INDUSTRY-LEADING SUCTION POWER: TruSteam's unique whisper-quiet motor is paired with larger fan blades and a high-capacity housing design to provide unprecedented ventilation. Backed by cutting-edge research, the TruSteam is the most powerful range hood available in the US (along with our Auto Clean model) with a CFM of 900+. That makes TruSteam especially suitable for high-fume, oil-based cooking, as is common with Chinese, Indian, Southeast Asian, and other popular cuisines. WHISPER-QUIET PERFORMANCE: Our revolutionary motor, invented by Pacific, is the quietest in the industry. The 6 different speed settings include one aptly named \"extremely silent.” Even at higher speeds, the TruSteam range hood operates at nearly inaudible levels. DEEP CONCAVE BOTTOM DESIGN: TruSteam is designed for homes where a range of things are cooked with oil at high temperatures. The novel concave shape keeps grease and oil from leaking and smoke out of your eyes while you’re cooking up that stir fry or juicy steak. FILTER-LESS FOR LESS MESS: The advanced centrifugal blower funnels smoke to the outside while depositing grease in the leak-proof residue cup. This filter-less design prevents grease build-up and reduces fire hazards.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41KIvuk5VIL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PACIFIC","source_asin":"B098JLP93P","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-99183","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B098JLP93P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B098JLP93P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
