window.products.push({"id":99240,"name":"ICEPURE 3-in-1 Water Cooler Dispenser with Built-in Ice Maker, Top Loading Water Cooler, Quick Make hot, Cold Water & Bullet-Shaped ice Cube, 44lbs/24","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":271.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61OtplVwT1L._SL1500_.jpg","description":"❄️【3 IN 1 Ice Maker With Hot/Cold Water Dispenser】--- Protable 3 IN 1 Ice machine combines the functions of an ice maker and a water dispenser, which can quickly make ice cubes, cool water (≤46.4℉), and hot water (≥194℉ and with Child Safe Lock ). Whether in hot summer or a chillsome winter, our ice water machine can meet your drinking needs. The child safety lock function prevents the accidental outflow of hot water, and family use is more assured. ❄️【Powerful Ice-making Function】---The water dispenser with an ice maker can make 12 pieces of Bullet-shaped ice at a time in 6-13mins (depending on temperature), and it can make 44lbs of bullet-shaped ice cubes per day. The ice tank can hold 4 lbs of ice cubes. Bullet-shaped ice cubes that don't melt or stick together quickly, are great for cooling drinks, fruits, or food on hot summer days. ❄️【Accessible to Use】---No installation required, no need to connect Inlet and drain pipes. The control panel is very easy to operate. Simply load any compatible 2, 3,4, or 5 gallons water jug into the water dispenser & ice maker or direct pour 0.79 gallons of water into it and enjoy the water and ice cubes in a few minutes. ❄️【Low Noise & Low Power Consumption】---The high-efficiency compressor refrigerates make ice quickly but does not make too much noise. you can enjoy a cool and quiet moment. If the ice cubes have not been used, melted water droplets will flow into the cold water tank to speed up the production of cold water. The reasonable design saves more resources, It can be used for countertops, kitchens, living rooms, bedrooms, offices, parties, picnics, boats, and more. ❄️【High-quality material & Guarantee】---Inner is Food-grade and BPA-free materials, the middle is Thick insulating material, and the outermost is stainless steel protective cover. Fashionable and with exquisite appearance, it can be placed anywhere in your home, saving space, beautiful and useful. The quality is guaranteed, and we also provide a one-year warranty service for free.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61OtplVwT1L._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ICEPURE","source_asin":"B0B18KX7WR","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-99240","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B18KX7WR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B18KX7WR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
