window.products.push({"id":99273,"name":"Wb44k10005 Bake Element Oven Range Broil Replacement Heating Wb44k10001 Ch44k10005 Ps249238 Ge Hotpoint Kenmore Rb787wh1ww Jbs07h2ww C2s985set8ss Jb25","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51O3-K-AkGS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💡 Heating Element Wb44k10005 - A high-quality exact equivalent for part numbers AP2030964, 824269, AH249238, EA249238, PS249238, WB44K10001. Bake Element Wb44k10005 is compatible with General Electric, Hotpoint, Kenmore appliances. Ge Wb44k10005 Oven Bake Heating Element fits hundreds of models and can be installed in a few minutes. 🔧 DIY eTips Included - Not sure how to replace the Ge Hotpoint Oven Element Wb44k10005? Helpful information can be found on the page below. Scroll down to get more repair tips. Acquire valuable skills during the DIY repair project. Ge Wb44k10005 Bake Element For Stove will help if your appliance has little to no heat when baking, element does not heat, oven does not heat evenly, or does not start. 💡 Ge Part Wb44k10005 is made of metal and is designed to generate heat by passing electrical current through it, which causes it to glow and emit heat. It is located at the bottom of the oven and is responsible for heating the oven to the desired temperature for baking. Part Wb44k10005 is designed to fit and function properly in the specified oven models. Wb44k10005 Element meets or exceed all manufacturer specifications. We provide a lifetime warranty and guarantee 100% money back. 💡 How do you replace the bottom heating element in an oven? To replace the oven element, disconnect the power first. Then, remove the screws securing the old element, gently pull it out, and inspect the terminals for damage. Attach the wires to the new element's terminals and mount it onto the back wall. Check that it's aligned properly and resting on its support legs. Reinstall the oven racks and restore power to finish. 💡 Are bake elements Universal? No, bake elements are not universal. While there are some similarities between different oven brands and models, the specifications for the bake element can vary greatly between them. Factors such as the size, shape, wattage, and voltage of the element can differ depending on the specific oven it is designed for. Therefore, it's important to ensure that you purchase a replacement bake element that is designed to fit your specific make and model of oven.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51O3-K-AkGS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PartsBroz","source_asin":"B07KPLSTXR","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-99273","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07KPLSTXR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07KPLSTXR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
