window.products.push({"id":99563,"name":"Waterdrop PLUS Refrigerator Water Filter, Replacement for GE® RPWF (Not RPWFE), RWF1063, RWF3600A, WSG-4, DWF-36, R-3600, MPF15350, OPFG3-RF300, WF277","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615o8gClOxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"⚠️ This filter is replacement for GE RPWF, but NOT model RPWFE. ⚠️ This Waterdrop WDP-F19 replacement water filter for GE refrigerator is comprehensively certified by the NSF against NSF/ANSI 401, 53, 42 &372 Standards test from each component to the filter cartridge as a whole to achieve a supreme filtration performance. This filter has been strictly certified by NSF 401 to reduce phenytoin, ibuprofen, naproxen, estrone and bisphenol A. Asides it has also been tested according to NSF 53 standards to reduce lead, benzene, mercury, PFOA&PFOS in water. 【Intense filtration】Waterdrop refrigerator filters reduce a wide range of harmful substances in water including chlorine, heavy metals, lead, mercury, odor, THM, VOCs, particles, cadmium, chromium, copper, and any other major impurities tested by independent laboratory to reduce these substances. The filter also works to retain many of the beneficial minerals that are essential in keeping our bodies running properly. 【Replacement for models】GE RPWF, Odoga RPWF, MORE Pure Filters MPF15350, Dista DWF-36, Refresh R-3600, EXCELPURE EP-RPWF, WaterSentinel WSG-4, Zuma Filter RPWF, Tier1 RWF1063, EXCELPURE EP-RPWF. 【Premium filter material】Instead of using charcoal containing coal, wood, walnut shell, and apricot shell, Waterdrop adopts 100% selected coconut shell carbon block from Sri Lanka that contains a surface area that is twice as large. This allows the filter cartridge to efficiently reduce chlorine and a wide range of heavy metals. With a detail-oriented thought we selected BPA-free and food-grade filter housing that passed NSF 372 certification for lead-free filtration. 【Fresh taste】The 100% coconut shell carbon block absorbs more impurities than low-priced and mixed carbon block. Waterdrop’s refrigerator filter significantly improves the taste of drinking water to provide the best water filtration experience possible. 【Replacement reminder stickers】Expired replacement filters might cause an accumulation of impurities and a lower level of filtration performance. Therefore, Waterdrop includes a complimentary set of monthly install stickers to remind you of your filter’s lifespan. The filter life is 6 months or 300 gallons (varies based on the water condition). GE is a registered trademark of General Electric Company. GE is used for reference purposes only.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615o8gClOxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WATERDROP","source_asin":"B01GADB068","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-99563","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01GADB068","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B01GADB068","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
