window.products.push({"id":99655,"name":"Soulhand Pour Over Filter, 18/8 Stainless Steel Reusable Cone Coffee Dripper for Size 02 Pour Over Coffee Maker (118mm)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WlCaf-quL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Enjoy pour over coffee, don't compromise on taste. The coffee dripping through the filter paper is like filtering the life of the hourglass in time. This kind of experience adds a sense of ritual to the coffee. In the morning, if you can prepare a hearty breakfast for yourself and make a cup of delicious coffee, I believe that the good mood of the day will be lighted! FEATURES: - Reusable filter. Don't waste your money. - Stainless steel 18/8 grade, filter out 99% of coffee grounds. - Meticulous design, stable flow rate. - More environmentally friendly than filter paper. - Soulhand coffee cone dripper is made with 304 food grade stainless steel to ensure the best brewing without any clogging or the annoying papery taste. SPECIFICATION: Material: 18/8 Stainless Steel  Bottle Diameter :118mm Size: ø4.2 in x H3.5 in / ø107.76 mm x H 87.7mm HOW TO USE: 1、Pour hot water over the dripper to preheat it. 2、Remove the water, fill with grounded coffee, tapping the edges. 3、Set unit over the designated cup or pot. 4、Pour 10% of water across the cones. 6、Wait for the water to brew. 5、Add rest of water slowly in a circular motion, keeping the water level consistent. 7、Remove the filter from the cup or pot. 8、Dump the grounds, scrub the filter, serve from the cup. PACKAGE INCLUDED: 1 * Stainless steel coffee filter","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WlCaf-quL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"soulhand","source_asin":"B07HSR251J","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-99655","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07HSR251J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07HSR251J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
